<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia stocks firm but back under 2,700 at noon.</title>
<headline>Australia stocks firm but back under 2,700 at noon.</headline>
<text>
<p>-----------------(Snapshot 12.00 p.m./0200 GMT)----------------</p>
